<title>USA: Lowe's Cos Inc January same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>Lowe's Cos Inc January same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH WILKESBORO, N.C. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lowe's Companies Inc said on Thursday same-store sales for January grew 13 percent over last year.</p>
<p>Sales totaled $524.0 million for the four week period ended January 31, a 29 percent increase over January 1996.</p>
</text>
